<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for contacting Arizona State University. Reserve Officer Training Corps is a program that prepares you for a potential career in the United States military as a commissioned officer, all while earning your college degree.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">ASU is one of the few universities in the nation that offers Army, Air Force and Navy ROTC units (Marine options are assigned to Navy ROTC). This program falls under the College of Liberal Arts and Sciences.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">In ROTC, you’ll make the most of your college experience. You’ll hone your time-management skills, analytical skills and physical fitness. You will be required to take specific military classes, which will include physical training and leadership laboratory, where you will develop your leadership and teamwork abilities.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">As a cadet or midshipman, there are many opportunities for scholarships and various training programs that the average college student would never have. Once you complete all mandatory training requirements and complete your bachelor’s degree, you will become a second lieutenant or ensign in your respective branch of service.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">The links below will provide more information about the ASU ROTC unit and respective branches of service.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><a href="https://afrotc.clas.asu.edu/?home">ASU Air Force ROTC</a></font></div><div><font face="arial"><a href="https://militaryscience.clas.asu.edu/">ASU Army ROTC</a></font></div><div><font face="arial"><a href="https://nrotc.asu.edu/">ASU Navy ROTC</a></font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>